<title>BELGIUM: EU says Bank Austria to sell Girocredit stake.</title>
<headline>EU says Bank Austria to sell Girocredit stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday Bank Austria had agreed to sell its stake in Girocredit in order to win EU approval for its acquisition of Creditanstalt.</p>
<p>&quot;Bank Austria and its parent AVZ have taken the commitment to sell off their stake in Girocredit, therefore the link between Bank Austria and Girocredit will be severed,&quot; it said in a statement. ((-- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841 ))</p>
</text>
